      "independent_solution": "Use b_n=b_1*q^(n-1), n=1,...,5, retaining the given first term as term 1. (a) 6,12,24,48,96. (b) -16,-8,-4,-2,-1. (c) 3/4,-1/2,1/3,-2/9,4/27. (d) -24,36,-54,81,-243/2, using q=-3/2. (e) 2/5,2*sqrt(2)/5,4/5,4*sqrt(2)/5,8/5, using (sqrt(2))^2=2. (f) 9/5,3*sqrt(3)/5,3/5,sqrt(3)/5,1/5, using q=sqrt(3)/3 and q^2=1/3. Negative q alternates signs; positive q preserves the first term's sign.",
